OL,3,GNEWSABurnham calls summit of Welsh,
OL,4,AScottish and Northern Irish first
OL,5,Aministers
OL,6,
OL,7,FDowning Street said the first ministers
OL,8,Fof Wales and Scotland, and the first
OL,9,Fand deputy first ministers of Northern
OL,10,FIreland will meet the prime minister at
OL,11,Fthe National Economic Council in
OL,12,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
